{
  "name": "site-build",
  "description": "Site building — visual reference (mockup image, Figma export, Claude Design export, or reference URL) → Design Spec → live Gantry outline. Surveys the install first to tell a NEW build from a REDESIGN and to inventory content the menu/content builds already prepared. Provisions the Joomla article/category substrate before any layout work, so every piece of homepage content stays editable in the article manager; on a redesign it works only inside a redesign parent category and copies live content rather than binding to it. Only two stages use a model.",
  "instructions": "site-build-agent.md",
  "tools": {
    "allow": [
      "set_active_site",
      "get_active_site",
      "get_agent_instructions",
      "get_site_notes",
